e-page-dungeon/?seed=125321\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=125321\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111499\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=111499\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Torgampuma Monster","legend":"Rumors say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits Torgampuma Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Reare Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 29 m long."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Picking Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 10 m long."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Moutewen Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Paign Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 36 m long."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Helstable Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Vilpsa Ghoul","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a hungry Ghoul who inhabits Vilpsa hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Pavaasaa Beast","legend":"Elders speak of a magical Beast who inhabits Pavaasaa hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Liekkavalo Warg","legend":"Inscriptions speak of a golden Warg who inhabits Liekkavalo hills and attacks anyone who dares to approach its lair."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Mez Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Hernoduro Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Corsoriapur Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Waldt Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Germanic Totems."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Raurilaco Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Rauritano Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Aldoretarai Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Qat Ekzib Pantheon."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Confluencan Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Romanism."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Seimaa Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Estian Idols."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Lantza Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Gasteasainese Gods."},{"id":"marker91","name":"Nam Hayitbal Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Basamat Gala Pantheon."},{"id":"marker92","name":"Otzi Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Gasteasainese Gods."},{"id":"marker93","name":"Laisaluna Rats","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker94","name":"Otziexa Crows","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker95","name":"Hatta Leopards","legend":"A gang of swamp brigands."},{"id":"marker96","name":"Rulapirtti Leopards","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker97","name":"Gorriara Tigers","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker98","name":"Kauvataska Boars","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker99","name":"Leguraiz Falcons","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker100","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker101","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker102","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker103","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker104","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker105","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker106","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker107","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker108","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker109","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker110","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker111","name":"Igansium Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༭༜༛༭༃་༔༨༖༳༉༣༛༖༫༉༗༦༤༺༳༥༱༗༁༚༒༵༻༜༇༫༱༉༣༻༨༉༓༨༕༢༡༄༗༒༒༜༌༓༽༦༯༙༂༢༰༌༩༄༯༼༶༯༣༇༐༕༵༗༰༘༳</div>"},{"id":"marker112","name":"Horne Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰሀነፐፐረሀጸጸደለሀገቀፀየ ነወቀረሠሐቀመፈከሰተሐከጰጠሰሀጸኀ ሀፐሀወጰጸደአዘቀጰ ነኀለዐበበዐፈተ ወአረከቀረለተጸመ ሐአመየተመበኀሰፐበቀገጸአሐደዐሰሰ ፀገዘጠ ረሠፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker113","name":"Shompibos Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡁᡮᡐᡕᡠᠳᠨᡖᢑᡞᡓᡖᢑᡁᡐᢓᢒᡑᠭᢥᡕᡭᢋᡁᢠᢓᡱᠽᢤᠾᡳᡓᢓᠮᠰᠭᡓᢓᢤᡔᠰᠰᢀᢤᡳᠡᠿᠪᡯᢡᡲᢑᠡᢏᡱᠿᢢᡖᢋᡓᡗᢒᠦᠽᠩᢤᢢᡀᢢᢓᠳᡍᢂᢥᡯᠭᡰᢛ</div>"},{"id":"marker114","name":"Cansiumbia Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802𐠢\udc02\udc1f 𐠃\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠅\udc03𐠅 \ud802𐠊\ud802\ud802𐠿\udc11\udc21\udc33\udc31𐠸\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠣\udc16\ud802𐠵</div>"},{"id":"marker115","name":"Norino Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳈⲼⳫⳄⳄ⳧ⳬⳆⳐⳃⳜⳭⳔ ⲾⳂⲸⳘ⳥ⲺⳲⳘ⳪Ⳑ ⳥⳾ⳞⲴⳃⳃⳆⳀⳖ ⳾ⳘⳞⳐ⳹⳩ⳈⳌⲴⳞⳬⳲ Ⳅ⳧ⳒⲴⳘⳁ⳩ⲺⲾⲾ⳪Ⳝ⳪ ⳜⳊⳊⳈⳖⳫⳆ Ⳏ⳧ⲺⲾⳲⳀⳄⲼ⳥</div>"},{"id":"marker116","name":"Korrelorroa Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳐⳊ⳾ⳒⳜⳲⳖⲺⳚⳭⳀⳭ ⳁⲶⳭⲸⲼ⳥ⳀⳆⳀ ⳆⳭⳂ⳩ⳜⳆⳠⲴⳄⳬⳘⳈⳀⳚⳊⳔ⳾ⳎⳀⲾⳖⲼⳈⳊⲴⳤⳂⳌⲾ </div>"},{"id":"marker117","name":"Harmah Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠢\udc2b\ud802𐠮𐠦\udc2a𐠏\udc34\udc2a\ud802𐠵\ud802𐠮\udc18\udc21\udc30\ud802𐠵\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc23\udc38\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc10\ud802\ud802𐠿\ud802𐠕\udc11 \udc18\udc3c\ud802𐠎\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠴𐠳\udc2d\udc2c\udc0a𐠣\udc32\udc33𐠱\udc05</div>"},{"id":"marker118","name":"Oredorio Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">አፈሐለፐኀጸሀደረ ደ ቀ ነ ወፐ ነሀፀየለከፐሀመሀፈወፈፈ ኀወሐፐገፀከገሰሰገ ሐኀጰዘጠረከጸሐጠ ጰበነጸደሐለሰኀመጰሐጠተከ  ለየፀተሀፀአሐገለፀደፀፀዘቀጰሐጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker119","name":"Dehieh Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༮༣༒༱༘༤༕༦༉༶༠༸༗༦་༵༷༪༽༂༘༃༕༫༙༄༌༄༅༠༣༘༴༵༜༜༷༻༔༱༠༉༰༻༒༧༿༸༧༶༐༱༭༭༦༑༕༣༗༼༤༳༤༦༄༗༌</div>"},{"id":"marker120","name":"Kejaalali Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc23𐠊\ud802 \udc02 \ud802\ud802𐠩\udc29\ud802𐠠\udc14\udc16 𐠒\udc16𐠨\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc2a\udc29\udc1a\udc0a\ud802𐠼𐠪\ud802𐠢\udc01</div>"},{"id":"marker121","name":"Yehu Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⳄ ⲺⳂⳔⳞⳘⲸ ⳲⳤⳃⳄⳘⲲⳫⳄ ⳀⳬⳖⳜⳜⲼⳖⲸⳀⳌⳈⲼⲼ Ⳬⳁ⳥ⳬⳜⳖⳬⳘⲴⳖⲶⳐ ⲶⲼ⳹ⳁⳁⲶ ⳆⲺⳎⳁ⳧ⳘⳲⳎⳔⳚⳆ⳥ⳃⲴⳞⳠⲴⳀⲶⲶ  Ⳇ⳩ⳤ⳥ⳬ⳩ⳘⲼⳘⳔⳖⳒⳫ⳥ⳒⳲⳐⲲ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Gornaiaga Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠭\udc03\ud802\ud802𐠟\udc1e𐠙𐠥\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802\ud802𐠠\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠝𐠄 \udc11\udc32\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠬\ud802𐠢\udc1e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠟 𐠁𐠌\udc19</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Tarnerusha Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳤⳭⳤ⳹ⲲⳭ ⲾⳀⳈⲺⳭⳞⳎⳒⳠⳈⳊⳤⳐⳎⳊ⳩ Ⳇ⳪ⳭⲺⳖ⳹ⳊⳂⳎⳌⳎⳬⲸⳀⳤⳐⳜⳄ ⳀⳒⳔⳁⳈⳞ ⳞⳔⲼⳔ⳧Ⲳⳃ⳾ ⳢⳭⳬ ⳭⳢⳘⳃⲶⲼⲾⳚⳈⳄⳫ ⳚⲾⳆⲾⳁ⳹⳪ⳢⳆⳂⳘ⳥ⳤⲺ⳾Ⳙ ⳖⳆⲼⳎ⳪ⳁ</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Benta Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳹ⳢⳜⳐ⳧ⳒⳘ⳹ⳤⳚⳄ⳪  ⳔⳖⲴⳒⳃⲼⳀⳃⳎⲾⳫⳜⲸⳀⲴⲴ⳩ⳫⳜⳘⳃⳆⳞⳀ ⳀⳬⳲⳢⲼⳠⳄⳤⳔⲲ⳩ⲸⲾⳒⳚⳈⳖⳂ ⳥ⲸⳌⳲⳲⳈⲺⳤ  Ⳕⳃ⳪ⲴⳀⳆⳂ</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Zeytus Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳢⲴ ⳭⳞⲴⳭⳞⳜⳖⳒⳚⲼ⳧⳧Ⲻ⳧ⳞⳂⳀⳃⳚⳐⲼ ⳫⳖⳔⳊⳘⳬⳐ⳧⳹ⳖⲼⳄⳐⳞⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Loncum Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">Ⳅ⳩ⳭⲼⲶⲺⳀⳞⳆ ⲲⲴⳞ⳹ⳬⳈⳀⳬⳞⲺ ⲼⳢⳘⳔ⳧ ⳾ⳤ⳪Ⳬ⳪ⳀⲾ⳹⳥Ⳗ⳹ⳲⳁⳫⳜⳞⳫⳠ⳥ⳠⳃⳌⳈⲼⳜⳫⳞⳢ⳥⳩ⲶⳠⳖⳠⲲⳤⳌⲶⳚⲲ Ⲿⳃ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Durkirten Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༌༵༾༾༱༢༜༫༺༿༢༺༙༵༙༖༥༠༚༈༅༇༐༄༑༮༩༊༦༿༥༰༚༾༲་༼༜༺༅༙༓༕༇༯༨༻༮༩༩༽༲༵༥༪༢༧༿༪༇༺༱༚༰༈༭༨༜༧༃༥༹༤༨ༀ༗༨༛་༣༔༨༣༠༰༓༡༹༫༉༽</div>