","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker146","name":"Mebar Collection","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker147","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker148","name":"Travelling Magical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker149","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker150","name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker151","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker152","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker153","name":"Liesika Melee","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a melee of the greats in Liesika, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker154","name":"Sievendini Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Sievendini, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker155","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Lugdurovio River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker156","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Syrjalanpaa Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker157","name":"Hounds migration","legend":"A huge group of hounds are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker158","name":"Elk migration","legend":"A huge group of elk are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker159","name":"Badgers migration","legend":"A huge group of badgers are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker160","name":"Tigers migration","legend":"A huge group of tigers are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker161","name":"Adnicrico carnival","legend":"A carnival has been organised at Adnicrico as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"id":"marker162","name":"Distant mirage","legend":"This distant mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker163","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker164","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker165","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker166","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker167","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker168","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker169","name":"Irugaobemoa Chasm","legend":"The Irugaobemoa Chasm. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker170","name":"Zierrunda Sinkhole","legend":"The Zierrunda Sinkhole. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker171","name":"Rautum Crypt","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker172","name":"Nonium Necropolis","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker173","name":"Harnah Necropolis","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker174","name":"Qat Arekoa Necropolis","legend":"A desolate necropolis where an eerie stillness reigns. Time seems frozen amidst the decaying mausoleums, and the silence is broken only by the whispers of the wind and the rustle of tattered banners."},{"id":"marker175","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4037\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker176","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/9255\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker177","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/24486\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker178","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/13645\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker179","name":"Random encounter","leg